{
  "name": "Suggestions",
  "kind": "component",
  "component": "TextField, io_neuroplast_hotty.suggestions",
  "icon": "search",
  "description": "Suggestions as you type, as bubbles' text input has them: the rest of the first that fits shows faint after the caret, and Tab or → at the end takes it; the others that start with what was typed show in a list under the field. ↓ and ↑ (Control+n, Control+p) move through it, Enter picks the one highlighted, Escape closes it; with nothing highlighted, Enter runs the form. Command has the keyboard with git c typed, five commands under it; delete the c to see a longer list scroll. Country is empty: type S. Its onInput tells the agent each change (suggest, with the query), so that one could rewrite /countries as the user types; here the list stays and the field narrows it. City holds Atlantis, which nothing matches, so its list stays shut. Tab with nothing to take moves on. On a host the field is plain: Blitz draws no list of its own yet (vault KIT-11h).",
  "messages": [
    {
